Package: ims.tutorials
Title: Tutorials for Introduction to Modern Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
    person(given = "David",
           family = "Kane",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "dave.kane@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6660-3934")))
Description: Collection of tutorials, one per chapter, accompanying
    'Introduction to Modern Statistics' by Mine Cetinkaya-Rundel and
    Johanna Hardin. Students work through each chapter's ideas in R,
    using AI to build an analysis in their own Quarto document. Built
    with the 'learnr2' package: each tutorial is a Quarto document
    rendered to a static web page.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
